description: All user-visible UI copy goes through i18n
globs: src/**/*.tsx,src/i18n/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Copy

- Screen chrome, buttons, errors, and empty states: `src/i18n/locales/en.ts` via `useI18n()`.
- Locale files are English-only today. Add a key to `en.ts`; do not invent `de.ts` until a locale switch exists.
- Sample portfolio names and message bodies stay in `src/sample/portal.ts`.
- Firm PDF titles stay in `DOCUMENT_KIND_LABELS` / `src/data/company.ts`.
- Do not hardcode new button labels in `DocumentPreviewDialog` — extend `PreviewCopy` or i18n.
